---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Editorial Policy — seoul.is" description="The editorial standards, fact-checking process, affiliate disclosure, and correction policy for SEOULIS (seoul.is).">
  <main style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 24px;color:var(--text);">

    <div style="margin-bottom:12px;">
      <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#C9A84C;">Transparency & Standards</span>
    </div>
    <h1 style="font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.2;">Editorial Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:48px;">Last updated: October 2025</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Our Editorial Mission</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;">
      SEOULIS (seoul.is) is committed to publishing accurate, fair, and editorially independent content about Korean culture, travel, entertainment, and lifestyle. Our editorial team is guided by principles of accuracy, transparency, and genuine value to readers. We do not allow commercial relationships to influence editorial decisions.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Content Standards</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px;">All content published on seoul.is must meet the following standards:</p>
    <ul style="line-height:2;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;padding-left:20px;">
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Accuracy:</strong> Facts, dates, names, and figures are verified against at least one authoritative source before publication.</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Attribution:</strong> Original sources are credited. We link to primary sources wherever possible.</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Fairness:</strong> Coverage is balanced. When reporting on controversies, we represent multiple perspectives.</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Relevance:</strong> Every story is selected because it provides genuine value to our readers — not for clicks or shock value.</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Timeliness:</strong> We strive to publish timely content and update articles when significant new information emerges.</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Independence:</strong> Editorial selections are made independently of advertisers and commercial partners.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Fact-Checking Process</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px;">Before any article is published, our editorial team follows this process:</p>
    <ol style="line-height:2;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;padding-left:20px;">
      <li>Content is sourced from our network of 50+ verified Korean and international media outlets.</li>
      <li>Key claims are cross-referenced against at least two independent sources.</li>
      <li>Korean-language sources are reviewed by team members with Korean language proficiency.</li>
      <li>Sensitive topics (legal issues, health, financial information) undergo additional review.</li>
      <li>Publication is approved by a senior editor before going live.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);padding-top:32px;">Affiliate & Sponsored Content Disclosure</h2>
    <div style="background:rgba(201,168,76,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 24px;margin-bottom:24px;">
      <p style="font-weight:700;color:#C9A84C;margin-bottom:8px;">⚠️ Important Disclosure</p>
      <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;">
        Some links on seoul.is are <strong style="color:var(--text);">affiliate links</strong>. This means that if you click a link and make a purchase or booking, seoul.is may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate links include travel bookings (hotels, flights, tours, eSIM), and other commerce partnerships. These are always labelled with <code style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;">rel="sponsored"</code> in our code and visually identified where possible.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px;">Our current affiliate and commercial partners include:</p>
    <ul style="line-height:2;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px;">
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Agoda</strong> — Hotel bookings in Seoul and Korea</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Klook</strong> — Tours, activities, and attractions in Korea</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Airalo</strong> — eSIM data plans for Korea travelers</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Aviasales / Travelpayouts</strong> — Flight search and comparison</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--text);">Ekta Traveling</strong> — Travel insurance</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;">
      Commercial relationships do not influence which destinations, products, or experiences we recommend. Our recommendations are based on editorial merit. We only partner with services we genuinely believe provide value to our readers.
    </p>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;">
      <strong style="color:var(--text);">Sponsored articles</strong> (paid content created in partnership with a brand) are clearly labelled "Sponsored" or "In Partnership With" at the top of the article. Sponsored content is subject to the same factual accuracy standards as editorial content, but the sponsor has input on the subject matter.
    </p>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;">
      <strong style="color:var(--text);">Google AdSense</strong> display advertising appears on our pages. These are served automatically by Google and are not editorial endorsements.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Correction Policy</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px;">
      We take errors seriously. If we publish incorrect information, we will:
    </p>
    <ol style="line-height:2;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px;">
      <li>Investigate the reported error promptly (within 48 hours of notification).</li>
      <li>Publish a correction note within the original article if the error is confirmed.</li>
      <li>For significant errors, publish a standalone correction or update notice.</li>
      <li>Never delete factual corrections — we stand behind our record.</li>
    </ol>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;">
      To report an error, please email: <a href="mailto:editorial@seoul.is" style="color:#C9A84C;font-weight:700;">editorial@seoul.is</a>
    </p>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;">
      Please include: the article URL, the specific claim you believe is incorrect, and any sources supporting the correction. We appreciate your help in keeping our content accurate.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">User-Generated Content</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:32px;">
      At this time, seoul.is does not publish user-submitted articles or comments. All published content is created or curated by the SEOULIS editorial team.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Contact the Editorial Team</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:8px;">For editorial inquiries, fact-checking questions, or correction requests:</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:8px;"><a href="mailto:editorial@seoul.is" style="color:#C9A84C;font-weight:700;">editorial@seoul.is</a></p>
    <p style="line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:8px;">For advertising, partnerships, or commercial inquiries:</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:0;"><a href="mailto:hello@seoul.is" style="color:#C9A84C;font-weight:700;">hello@seoul.is</a></p>

  </main>
</Base>
